{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"componentIndex"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Storages address their per-type state and the per-entity component bitset by this value.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The default implementation assigns indices lazily: the first access of a type takes the next free index","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of the process, later accesses look it up in a thread-safe table. The index is process-wide, not per ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so all nexuses of a process agree on it. Indices are dense (","type":"text"},{"code":"0 ..< n","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for ","type":"text"},{"code":"n","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" types used so far) and unbounded.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"They depend on the order of first use and are not stable between process launches;"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"use "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/RegistrableComponent\/stableIdentifier","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" for persistent data."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift has no stored static properties in generic types, so a plain conformance can not cache its index in a static."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Provide your own implementation (the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Component"},{"type":"text","text":" macro will) as a stored "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"static let"},{"type":"text","text":" for a plain load,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"but only if you can guarantee that two types never share an index and that it is in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0 ..< 1_048_576"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Indices are process-wide: a hand-assigned index must not collide with a lazily assigned one of another type."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A collision or an index out of range traps at first use of the type in a nexus."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Complexity","type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"O(1)","type":"text"}]}]}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"The dense index of this component type.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component\/componentIndex-5oxlf"},"sections":[],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:12FirebladeECS9ComponentPAAE14componentIndexSivpZ","symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"componentIndex"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"FirebladeECS"}],"roleHeading":"Type Property","extendedModule":"FirebladeECS","title":"componentIndex"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/component\/componentindex-5oxlf"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"references":{"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/Nexus":{"url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/nexus","abstract":[],"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Nexus"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Nexus"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus","role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"Nexus"},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/RegistrableComponent/componentTypeName":{"url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/registrablecomponent\/componenttypename","abstract":[{"text":"The stable, unique name of this component type.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"componentTypeName","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","required":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/RegistrableComponent\/componentTypeName","title":"componentTypeName","kind":"symbol","defaultImplementations":1},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/RegistrableComponent/stableIdentifier":{"title":"stableIdentifier","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The stable identifier of this component type, derived from "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/RegistrableComponent\/componentTypeName"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"stableIdentifier","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12FirebladeECS25StableComponentIdentifierV","text":"StableComponentIdentifier","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/RegistrableComponent\/stableIdentifier","role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/registrablecomponent\/stableidentifier"},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS":{"url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A lightweight, fast and easy to use Entity-Component System in Swift."}],"type":"topic","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS","title":"FirebladeECS","kind":"symbol"},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/Component/componentIndex-5oxlf":{"title":"componentIndex","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The dense index of this component type."}],"fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"componentIndex","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component\/componentIndex-5oxlf","role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/component\/componentindex-5oxlf"},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/Component":{"title":"Component","abstract":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Component","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"}],"fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Component","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Component","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component","role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/component"}}}